    "Name": "Grand Titan T-IT-N10X",
    "Details": "The Grand Titan T-IT-N10X is a pre-production prototype, armed with two one-shot Streak SRM 2 launchers as last-ditch weapons. The 'Mech first had them mounted high on the shoulders, but targeting problems pushed VEST to move them to the wrists. It eventually lost them entirely in favor of more heat sinks and missile reloads in the production -N10M variant. The T-IT-N10X was first tested on Solaris, where it appeared in promotional materials after a famous win over an Atlas in a Class 4 arena.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
